# =============================================================================
#  assets/textures/colony_cover.pix  —  the collection page's cover for Colony
# =============================================================================
#  The companion to iso_cover.pix, and the same rule: a card on the collection page
#  must show something, and a cover comes through one of the four doors.
#
#  What the colony actually looks like from a distance is agents scattered over a
#  dark field with the design-system panel down the right-hand side — which is the
#  whole point of that scene, since it exists to exercise ECS + jobs + the UI at
#  once. Two of the agents are drawn in the highlight colour: they are the ones
#  carrying something.
#
#  Re-bake after editing:
#      ./build/demo --cmd asset.pixels textures/colony_cover.pix textures/colony_cover.hrt
# =============================================================================

size 64
grid 1 1

palette b 141821ff     # the field
palette p 1e2530ff     # the panel down the right
palette l 3d4757ff     # a control in it
palette a 78b4e6ff     # an agent
palette A f0c86eff     # ...one carrying something
palette r 8a6b4aff     # a resource pile

tile 0
